om?\n\nWait, maybe the breakdown is wrong. Let me check the components again.\n\nWait, 550,091 is 500,000 +50,000 +0 +90 +1. But 500,000 +50,000 is 550,000. Then 550,000 +0 is 550,000. Then 550,000 +90 is 550,090. Then 550,090 +1 is 550,091. Correct.\n\n323,377 is 300,000 +20,000 +3,000 +300 +70 +7. Correct.\n\nSo adding the components:\n\n500,000 +300,000=800,000\n\n50,000 +20,000=70,000\n\n0 +3,000=3,000\n\n90 +300=390\n\n1 +70=71\n\n0 +0=0\n\nAdding those:800,000 +70,000=870,000; 870,000 +3,000=873,000; 873,000 +390=873,390; 873,390 +71=873,461; 873,461 +0=873,461.\n\nBut according to the vertical addition, it's 873,468. So there's a difference of 7. Where is that?\n\nWait, maybe the breakdown is missing some digits. Wait, 550,091 is 550,000 +91. 323,377 is 323,000 +77. So adding 550,000 +323,000=873,000. Then 91 +77=168. So total is 873,000 +168=873,168. Wait, but that's not matching either. Wait, 550,091 +323,377=550,091 +323,000=873,091 +377=873,468. Ah! There we go. So 550,091 +323,000=873,091. Then 873,091 +377=873,468. So that's correct. So the breakdown method was wrong because when adding 550,091 +323,377, it's 550,091 +323,000 +377. So 550,091 +323,000=873,091. Then 873,091 +377=873,468. So the breakdown into 500,000 +300,000=800,000 is incorrect because 550,091 is not 500,000 +50,000. Wait, 550,091 is 500,000 +50,091. So 500,000 +300,000=800,000. Then 50,091 +3,377=53,468. So total is 800,000 +53,468=853,468. Wait, that's not matching either. Wait, this is getting too confusing. Let me just do the addition step by step once more.\n\n550,091 + 323,377.\n\nStart with 550,091 + 323,377.\n\nLet's add the numbers digit by digit:\n\nStarting from the right:\n\n1. Ones place:1 +7=8.\n\n2. Tens place:9 +7=16. Write 6, carryover 1.\n\n3. Hundreds place:0 +3=3 +1=4.\n\n4. Thousands place:5 +3=8.\n\n5. Ten thousands place:5 +2=7.\n\n6. Hundred thousands place:5 +3=8.\n\nSo the sum is 873,468. Therefore, the correct answer is 873,468. The previous breakdown method 